+      "zh": "2026-10-15，整合 I3b（Ren：“a lot proofs are probably not integrated”）：在脊柱上陈述（新核心模块 Becoming.Granularity，新桥接 Becoming.GranularityBridge）。块是同一展开的有限路径（Frame.blocks），块的历史即写出的较细历史（Frame.blocks_trace_iff）；块的每个分支检验都是较细检验，在相同配置成立，不加前提（Frame.holds_blocks）。在较细粒度相同或同测的配置在块中亦然（Alike.blocks、SameBranchingTests.blocks）；每个较细动作自成一块时，块的检验恢复每个较细检验（Frame.blocks_sameBranchingTests_iff，充分非必要），两种描述的核相同（Frame.blocks_kernel_iff）。以另一粒度读同一展开的一般律：两框架的检验各自译入较细框架、译文在两配置处一致、接收侧每步结果列出时，前者的每段历史由后者以相同步匹配，终点译文仍一致（Translates.history_matches_of_em）；排中律为具名假设 em，外围的经典推理正在此处；列出的结果给出每段有限路径的终点，不用选择（outcomes_of_trace）。保留引用的块保持起点并计入其中每次形成（Joining.retained_blocks_extend，外围的登记模型编译后用 propext，故在核心的保留框架上重述）。桥接表明外围的块即核心的（blocks_ofModel，按定义），编译问题即较细检验（BranchingTest.toTest_finer）：compile_correct、blocks_trace_iff、singleton_coverage_recovers_questions、full_and_block_reduced_kernels 逐字成立，不加假设；finite_trace_endpoints 与 blocks_image_finite 外围以经典选择证明，核心不用选择；cross_granularity_history_matches 以 em 为假设。公理报告为空（草稿构建；回执随落地）。外围证明及其回执保持原范围。",
+      "en": "15 October 2026, integration I3b (Ren: “a lot proofs are probably not integrated”): stated on the spine (new core module Becoming.Granularity, new bridge Becoming.GranularityBridge). A block is a finite course of the same unfolding (Frame.blocks), and a history of blocks is the finer history written out (Frame.blocks_trace_iff); every branching test of blocks is a finer test holding at the same configurations, with no premise (Frame.holds_blocks). Configurations alike, or passing the same tests, at the finer grain are so in blocks (Alike.blocks, SameBranchingTests.blocks); where every finer move is a block of its own, the tests of blocks recover every finer test (Frame.blocks_sameBranchingTests_iff, sufficient, not necessary) and two descriptions have one kernel (Frame.blocks_kernel_iff). The general law of reading one unfolding at another grain: where the tests of two frames translate into finer frames, the translations agree at two configurations and each move of the receiving side has listed outcomes, every history of the first is matched by one of the second by the same steps, ending where the translations agree again (Translates.history_matches_of_em); excluded middle is the named hypothesis em, which is where the periphery reasoned classically, and listed outcomes give the endpoints of every finite course with no choice (outcomes_of_trace). Blocks of retained references keep where the course started and count every formation within (Joining.retained_blocks_extend, restated on the core’s retained frame because the periphery’s register model compiles through propext). The bridge shows the periphery’s blocks are the core’s (blocks_ofModel, by definition) and its compiled questions the finer tests (BranchingTest.toTest_finer): compile_correct, blocks_trace_iff, singleton_coverage_recovers_questions and full_and_block_reduced_kernels hold as stated with no added hypothesis; finite_trace_endpoints and blocks_image_finite, chosen classically in the periphery, need no choice in the core; cross_granularity_history_matches holds with em. Empty axiom reports (scratch build; the receipt comes with the landing). The periphery proofs and their receipts keep their scope."
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "2026-10-20: 8 bookkeeping notes condensed from 16 October 2026 to 20 October 2026: receipts rebound, sources re-pointed or rehashed after reading their changes, with the claim unchanged. Each note is kept verbatim in the snapshot _process/architecture/history/ff89413324fa6362/finite-granularity-question-recovery.json and in git.",
+      "zh": "2026-10-20：8 条记账性说明合并（16 October 2026 至 20 October 2026）：收据重绑、来源重指或重算哈希，主张不变。每条原文保存在快照 _process/architecture/history/ff89413324fa6362/finite-granularity-question-recovery.json 和 git 中。"
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "20 October 2026, R35 (twentieth review, E8): proof references to superseded periphery modules (ExplanatoryGranularity and GranularityBridge) re-roled as provenance, with their declarations kept, and their bindings dropped; the current proof is the modules it still cites as proof (Becoming.Granularity). The retired modules' content is also stated in Becoming.Grains, which this record does not cite with declarations. 2 aliases naming retired declarations are marked \"(retired module)\". The claim is unchanged.",
+      "zh": "20 October 2026, R35 (twentieth review, E8)：对已被取代的外围模块（ExplanatoryGranularity and GranularityBridge）的证明引用改为来源（provenance），保留其声明，删去其绑定；当前证明是本记录仍作为证明引用的模块（Becoming.Granularity）。退役模块的内容也陈述于 Becoming.Grains，本记录未以声明引用它们。2 个指向退役声明的别名标为“(retired module)”。主张不变。"
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "28 October 2026: migrated to schema 2 (DF3 batch B, study section 441): title kept; a statement written from the home section and the claim; the claim split into 8 laws, each read against its declarations in Becoming.Granularity, with the conditions the Lean takes written in (listed outcomes of the receiving side, excluded middle for matching, each finer move named by a block of itself for the kernels); the hypotheses kept, with excluded middle named, the periphery's ImageFinite read as listed outcomes and Exact/Reduced as each kernel being its sameness of tests, and a third saying where excluded middle enters; the limitations to four does-not-show items and the standard boundaries no-ethical-premise, decidability, discrete-steps and zero-axiom-target-open; the counterexample, which only repeated the limitations, replaced by the case ExplanatoryGranularityBoundary.lean witnesses (two branches alike on completed-block and prefix tests, one able to lose its continuation midway), its sentences carried by those items; the evidence paragraph rewritten from the receipts; the next step's instruction to reuse dropped; Frame.blocks_translates added to Granularity.lean's references; no premise, status, proof binding or source hash changed. Every earlier sentence is mapped in [finite-granularity-question-recovery.md](../../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-repository-reconciliation/architecture/df/df3-mapping/finite-granularity-question-recovery.md); the exact earlier record is the first text_versions entry. The migration's skeptical review was taken in the counterexamples, each read against the Lean it cites.",
+      "zh": "2026年10月28日：迁移到 schema 2（DF3 第二批，研究第 441 节）：标题不变；依主章与主张写出陈述；主张拆为 8 条规律，各条对照 Becoming.Granularity 中的声明核读，写入 Lean 所取的条件（接收侧结果已列出、匹配用排中律、核相等需每个较细动作自成一块）；前提保留，写明排中律，外围的 ImageFinite 读作结果已列出，Exact/Reduced 读作各核恰为检验相同，并加第三条说明排中律从何处进入；限制改为四条“未表明”与通用边界 no-ethical-premise、decidability、discrete-steps、zero-axiom-target-open；反例只重复限制，已换为 ExplanatoryGranularityBoundary.lean 所见证的情形（两个分支在完成块与前缀检验上相同，其一可在中途失去其接续），其句由这些条目承载；证据段按回执重写；删去下一步中复用的指示；Frame.blocks_translates 加入 Granularity.lean 的引用；前提、状态、证明绑定与来源哈希均未改变。每句旧文本的去向见 [finite-granularity-question-recovery.md](../../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-repository-reconciliation/architecture/df/df3-mapping/finite-granularity-question-recovery.md)；迁移前的完整记录为 text_versions 首项。迁移的审查意见已采纳，涉及反例，各条对照所引 Lean 核读。"
